<theodulf. carm. 78.1>	...
<theodulf. carm. 78.2>	Albinus precibus postulet ipse suis.
<theodulf. carm. 78.3>	Ut felix vivas instantis turbine mundi,
<theodulf. carm. 78.4>	Haec tua deposcit vernula turba deum;
<theodulf. carm. 78.5>	Tempora post saecli paradysi in sede locatus
<theodulf. carm. 78.6>	Praemia percipias, quae sine fine manent.
<theodulf. carm. 78.7>	Huic coniuncta viro Ermengardis, amabilis uxor,
<theodulf. carm. 78.8>	Sis regina valens tempus in omne bene,
<theodulf. carm. 78.9>	Cum quo per multos vivas feliciter annos
<theodulf. carm. 78.10>	Deque tua sobolem cernere prole queas.
<theodulf. carm. 78.11>	Tu decus o regni, imperii fidissima spesque,
<theodulf. carm. 78.12>	Sat bene, Hlothari, pulcher ephoebe, vale.
<theodulf. carm. 78.13>	Teque tuos Christi nectat dilectio fratres,
<theodulf. carm. 78.14>	Ut vosmet nullus hostis adire queat.
<theodulf. carm. 78.15>	Sic mundi regnum mundi teneatis in arvis,
<theodulf. carm. 78.16>	Ut vos post mortem regna superna habeant.
